<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
        color: #333;
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #f4f4f5;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #004174 0%, #00568f 100%);
        width: 100%;
        padding: 28px 16px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .header img {
        width: 149px;
        height: 32px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 32px 24px;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #fff;
      }

      .title {
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #333;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .details-box {
        background-color: #f8f9fa;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }

      .details-box h3 {
        color: #004174;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #004174;
        padding-bottom: 10px;
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .detail-row {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 8px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .detail-row:last-child {
        border-bottom: none;
      }

      .detail-label {
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #6c757d;
      }

      .detail-value {
        color: #004174;
        font-weight: 500;
        text-align: right;
      }

      .next-steps {
        margin-top: 24px;
      }

      .next-steps h3 {
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #333;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      .next-steps ol {
        padding-left: 20px;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .next-steps li {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .footer {
        padding: 16px 32px;
        background-color: #f9fafb;
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        text-align: center;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="header">
      <img
        src="https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/cvtocareer-394713.appspot.com/o/laigusbucket%2FC2C.png?alt=media&token=2c05d23e-1974-4a83-8143-99c1b6b96801"
        alt="CVtoCAREER"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <h1 class="title">Plan Change Notification</h1>
      <p>Dear Team,</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px">
        An admin has changed a client's plan in the CVtoCAREER system.
      </p>

      <div class="details-box">
        <h3>📋 Plan Change Details</h3>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Customer ID</span>
          <span class="detail-value"><%= customerId %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Sign Up As</span>
          <span class="detail-value"><%= signupAs %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Plan</span>
          <span class="detail-value"><%= planFrom %> &rarr; <%= planTo %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Sub end date</span>
          <span class="detail-value"><%= subEndFrom %> &rarr; <%= subEndTo %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Why</span>
          <span class="detail-value"><%= why %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Changed by</span>
          <span class="detail-value"><%= adminName %> &middot; <%= timestamp %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Client told</span>
          <span class="detail-value"><%= clientTold %></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="next-steps">
        <h3>Recommended Next Steps</h3>
        <ol>
          <li>Read the "why". That is the whole point of it being written down.</li>
          <li>Check the entitlement. If client profiles or CV uplift changed, the queue may need attention.</li>
          <li>Aggregators. Confirm the job boards match the new plan.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af">
        &copy; <%= currentYear %> CVtoCAREER PTY LTD. All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
